<title>JAPAN: Market view of Japan economy improving--BOJ.</title>
<headline>Market view of Japan economy improving--BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The view of financial markets about Japan's economy has been improving, and this has helped support rises in Japanese share prices and the yen, Bank of Japan (BOJ) executive director Yutaka Yamaguchi told a parliamentary committee on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
